+# DIE: P3 of #1202 retires the `local/` namespace so a slug stops being RENAMED
+# when its provenance changes. Publishing already renames today -- export_pr.py
+# strips `local/` and re-prefixes the compose-derived engine namespace -- and
+# after the hard-cut that arithmetic collapses to identity, so publish becomes a
+# pure VALUE flip and a user's scripts, notes and compose pins survive it.
+# promote.py, demote.py, export_pr.py and the cockpit are the prefix-dependent
+# consumers this field retires.
